{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FBC: Firebreak is a cooperative first-person shooter set within a mysterious federal agency under assault by otherworldly forces. As a years-long siege on the agency\u2019s headquarters reaches a breakpoint, only Firebreak\u2014 the Bureau\u2019s most versatile unit\u2014has the gear and the guts to plunge into the building\u2019s strangest crises, restore order, contain the chaos, and fight to reclaim control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the Federal Bureau of Control\u2019s (FBC) unpredictable and extradimensional headquarters during its darkest\u2014and strangest\u2014hours. As one of the FBC\u2019s fearless first responders, you and your team are on call to confront everything from reality-warping anomalies to otherworldly monsters... no matter the odds. Will you contain the chaos or finally lose control?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends or strangers to tackle each crisis as a well-oiled crew. Survival in this three-player cooperative FPS hinges on quick thinking and seamless teamwork as you scramble to tame raging paranatural crises across a variety of unexpected locations. Improve your odds by utilizing the tools and skills that make you unique or improvising with whatever\u2019s on hand to support your crew.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before deploying, select your weapon and customize your Firebreaker\u2019s Crisis Kit with specialized tools, grenades, support items, and paranatural augments... then modify them to suit your strategy and change the way you play. Experiment with different loadouts to perfect your playstyle and synergize with your team, giving you the edge to succeed in every crisis, no matter the difficulty.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the strange and unexpected world of Control or venture in for the first time in this standalone, multiplayer experience. Discover the iconic and unfathomable headquarters of the FBC \u2014 the Oldest House \u2014 from an entirely new perspective as a team of volunteer first responders who'll stop at nothing to save what's left of the Bureau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Firebreak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/bf2abea2ffc1debda0a2c210e9753b3bfc72ee68.jpg"},{"name":"Risk Allowance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/599f777908eed772a9ac81c1aed5d22054426015.jpg"},{"name":"Danger Pay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/f3f5a549b84fa9f65beaee0d84939b5d6a1df389.jpg"},{"name":"Hazard Pay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/6a69da2f4cf39cababaa5d981cea80ad73877cae.jpg"},{"name":"OSHA Compliant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/9fdbf8d758f4ea1edb9bd220aa71eb2ecc7eeff3.jpg"},{"name":"Just Here to Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/88c230a843ced4898d627913a3f1f7df9e944ca7.jpg"},{"name":"What a Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/10111b3a3190a3cd2456cce8be02d69ebcf4c0da.jpg"},{"name":"10 Days Without Incident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/91c5fc3857089d0af70d2b646db732a6b93f3456.jpg"},{"name":"First Response","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/25b1f6ad098904e1f88ed1d5a8bbb3a62666a48c.jpg"},{"name":"Break Time's Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2272540/a7b4e993470ce2009f859d15aba43365fd2780d2.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2272540?t=1768820456","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2272540?t=1768820456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/42c645f78308aeb9b76cefb54c1da7eac0b2c29d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1768820456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/42c645f78308aeb9b76cefb54c1da7eac0b2c29d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1768820456","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>What\u2019s New in The Latest Free Update Rogue Protocol</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Shift</strong> - A brand-new, roguelite game mode that fundamentally changes the way you play and progress in the game. Descend into crisis areas where enemy waves ramp up fast. Earn Corruption between rounds and upgrade your gear to keep the Hiss at bay. Every run is different, every decision matters, and the objective is simple: hold the line for as long as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Cosmetics</strong> \u2013 CONTROL themed armor sets, helmets and sprays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat\u00a0</strong>- Cross-platform voice chat is available since November making it easier than ever to coordinate, adapt and clutch those last-second saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cd5712435853d2e4eaaa46782bd509c5.avif?t=1768820456\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FBC: Firebreak is a cooperative first-person shooter set within a mysterious federal agency under assault by otherworldly forces. As a years-long siege on the agency\u2019s headquarters reaches a breakpoint, only Firebreak\u2014 the Bureau\u2019s most versatile unit\u2014has the gear and the guts to plunge into the building\u2019s strangest crises, restore order, contain the chaos, and fight to reclaim control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the Federal Bureau of Control\u2019s (FBC) unpredictable and extradimensional headquarters during its darkest\u2014and strangest\u2014hours. As one of the FBC\u2019s fearless first responders, you and your team are on call to confront everything from reality-warping anomalies to otherworldly monsters... no matter the odds. Will you contain the chaos or finally lose control?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends or strangers to tackle each crisis as a well-oiled crew. Survival in this three-player cooperative FPS hinges on quick thinking and seamless teamwork as you scramble to tame raging paranatural crises across a variety of unexpected locations. Improve your odds by utilizing the tools and skills that make you unique or improvising with whatever\u2019s on hand to support your crew.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before deploying, select your weapon and customize your Firebreaker\u2019s Crisis Kit with specialized tools, grenades, support items, and paranatural augments... then modify them to suit your strategy and change the way you play. Experiment with different loadouts to perfect your playstyle and synergize with your team, giving you the edge to succeed in every crisis, no matter the difficulty.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1768820456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1768820456 width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the strange and unexpected world of Control or venture in for the first time in this standalone, multiplayer experience. Discover the iconic and unfathomable headquarters of the FBC \u2014 the Oldest House \u2014 from an entirely new perspective as a team of volunteer first responders who'll stop at nothing to save what's left of the Bureau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.poster.avif?t=1768820456\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.webm?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.mp4?t=1768820456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Remedy Entertainment"],"dlc":[3625720],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/4b14357e440340c37d1c524c54a92a1341827edf/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1768820456","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed and published by Remedy Entertainment Plc. FBC: Firebreak Copyright \u00a9 Remedy Entertainment Plc 2025. \u201cFBC: Firebreak\u201d, \u201cNorthlight\u201